1
00:00:08,196 --> 00:00:16,508
Jin: What are you doing? I miss you already
Yoon Su: I miss you too (types it then deletes it)

2
00:00:25,199 --> 00:00:25,760
What're you looking at?

3
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:27,030
Shit!

4
00:00:27,030 --> 00:00:29,630
Rock paper scissors!

5
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:31,840
So... anything you wanna do?

6
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:33,480
Hmm not sure

7
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:34,562
You?

8
00:00:34,563 --> 00:00:36,993
Plenty of things I wanna do with you

9
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:38,900
Cheers?

10
00:00:41,175 --> 00:00:43,023
What are you doing?

11
00:01:11,660 --> 00:01:13,810
Ugh it's freezing

12
00:01:13,810 --> 00:01:15,728
What took you so long?

13
00:01:15,729 --> 00:01:18,278
Wait did you already finish moving?

14
00:01:18,278 --> 00:01:19,960
Can you get this?

15
00:01:19,960 --> 00:01:21,581
Hurry up!

16
00:01:29,157 --> 00:01:30,890
After Jin left the share house

17
00:01:30,890 --> 00:01:34,030
Some time passed and we moved too

18
00:01:34,030 --> 00:01:35,130
The biggest reason was

19
00:01:35,130 --> 00:01:37,970
Because I didn't want to feel his absence

20
00:01:37,970 --> 00:01:42,460
He was someone who affected me that much in every way

21
00:01:50,710 --> 00:01:53,910
Oh a new roommate's moving in this Saturday

22
00:01:53,910 --> 00:01:55,600
Oh really?

23
00:01:55,600 --> 00:01:57,403
He'll probably get here around one or two

24
00:01:57,404 --> 00:01:59,429
Anyone gonna be home Saturday afternoon?

25
00:01:59,430 --> 00:02:01,690
I'm busy this week

26
00:02:01,690 --> 00:02:02,760
I've got plans

27
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:05,839
I'm going back home this weekend too

28
00:02:06,270 --> 00:02:08,100
What about you Yoon Su

29
00:02:08,100 --> 00:02:12,190
Uh… I don't really have plans this weekend

30
00:02:12,190 --> 00:02:14,360
Then you can welcome him

31
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:15,120
Me?

32
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:16,740
Yeah

33
00:02:16,740 --> 00:02:17,937
It's nothing serious

34
00:02:17,938 --> 00:02:19,599
Just like when you first moved in

35
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:21,570
Show them around

36
00:02:21,570 --> 00:02:23,122
That's all you need to do

37
00:02:23,123 --> 00:02:23,936
Yeah

38
00:02:23,937 --> 00:02:25,730
You'll be living together anyway

39
00:02:25,730 --> 00:02:27,314
So it works out

40
00:02:29,130 --> 00:02:31,545
Yeah I'll do it

41
00:02:32,612 --> 00:02:35,302
I wonder what kind of person he'll be

42
00:02:35,303 --> 00:02:36,969
The soup's a bit salty

43
00:02:36,970 --> 00:02:38,400
Yeah?

44
00:03:27,130 --> 00:03:30,070
You must be the new roommate moving in today right?

45
00:03:30,070 --> 00:03:30,880
Yes

46
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:32,392
Let me help you with your bags

47
00:03:32,393 --> 00:03:34,343
Oh it's okay

48
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:41,380
So this is the living room

49
00:03:41,380 --> 00:03:42,915
That room there is the triple

50
00:03:42,916 --> 00:03:44,682
And this one's the double

51
00:03:44,683 --> 00:03:45,859
Okay

52
00:04:03,077 --> 00:04:06,180
The others all had plans

53
00:04:06,180 --> 00:04:08,630
So they'll probably be back in the evening

54
00:04:08,630 --> 00:04:10,160
Okay

55
00:04:10,160 --> 00:04:11,670
Is this your room?

56
00:04:11,670 --> 00:04:12,510
Yeah

57
00:04:12,510 --> 00:04:14,290
So you're my roommate

58
00:04:14,290 --> 00:04:15,628
What's your name?

59
00:04:15,629 --> 00:04:17,600
I'm Nam Yoon Su

60
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:18,840
I'm Go Tae Hyun

61
00:04:18,840 --> 00:04:20,380
Nice to meet you

62
00:04:33,534 --> 00:04:36,110
Wanna join me for dinner?

63
00:04:41,908 --> 00:04:44,390
Oh did you cook this yourself?

64
00:04:44,391 --> 00:04:46,720
Yeah I was making my own anyway

65
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:48,030
Thanks

66
00:05:00,190 --> 00:05:02,540
Do you usually cook?

67
00:05:02,540 --> 00:05:04,670
Just really basic stuff

68
00:05:04,670 --> 00:05:05,740
It's good

69
00:05:05,740 --> 00:05:08,230
Really? that's a relief

70
00:05:08,230 --> 00:05:09,600
How old are you by the way?

71
00:05:09,600 --> 00:05:11,350
You look young

72
00:05:11,350 --> 00:05:13,280
I'm 26

73
00:05:13,280 --> 00:05:14,510
Oh

74
00:05:14,510 --> 00:05:16,289
You're older than I thought

75
00:05:18,276 --> 00:05:20,009
I'm 27

76
00:05:20,010 --> 00:05:21,500
We can talk casually right?

77
00:05:21,500 --> 00:05:23,423
Yeah of course

78
00:05:24,791 --> 00:05:25,969
Alright

79
00:05:25,970 --> 00:05:27,550
You in school?

80
00:05:27,550 --> 00:05:29,220
No I work

81
00:05:29,220 --> 00:05:30,240
What about you?

82
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:32,740
Me too well not exactly

83
00:05:32,740 --> 00:05:35,010
I work as a trainer at a gym

84
00:05:35,010 --> 00:05:36,630
Seriously that's crazy

85
00:05:36,630 --> 00:05:38,964
I was actually looking into PT

86
00:05:38,965 --> 00:05:40,279
Want me to train you?

87
00:05:40,280 --> 00:05:41,984
How much is it?

88
00:05:41,985 --> 00:05:43,003
Money for what

89
00:05:43,004 --> 00:05:44,049
Forget it

90
00:05:44,050 --> 00:05:45,890
Hey I can't just take that

91
00:05:45,890 --> 00:05:47,780
This is a share house right?

92
00:05:47,780 --> 00:05:51,030
Let's call it a talent share or something

93
00:05:51,030 --> 00:05:52,018
Uh…

94
00:05:52,018 --> 00:05:54,950
But I don't really have anything to trade you

95
00:05:54,951 --> 00:05:57,036
You just don't know it yet

96
00:06:00,350 --> 00:06:02,750
We're back

97
00:06:02,750 --> 00:06:03,270
What

98
00:06:03,270 --> 00:06:05,200
Why are you two coming in together?

99
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:06,210
Ran into each other on the way

100
00:06:06,210 --> 00:06:07,480
Yeah

101
00:06:07,481 --> 00:06:08,660
Hello

102
00:06:08,660 --> 00:06:10,290
You're the new roommate right?

103
00:06:10,290 --> 00:06:11,920
We got chicken and drinks

104
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:14,880
For a little welcome party

105
00:06:18,170 --> 00:06:21,060
Alright grab one first

106
00:06:22,490 --> 00:06:23,120
Okay cheers

107
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:25,338
Come on cheers cheers cheers

108
00:06:25,339 --> 00:06:27,571
Cheers!

109
00:06:28,103 --> 00:06:30,189
Let's go! let's go!

110
00:06:31,220 --> 00:06:33,210
Man it's cold

111
00:06:34,334 --> 00:06:35,150
Whoa Taehyun

112
00:06:35,150 --> 00:06:36,856
No wonder your body feels like this

113
00:06:36,857 --> 00:06:38,910
Can I touch it?

114
00:06:40,070 --> 00:06:42,010
Whoa

115
00:06:43,510 --> 00:06:45,090
Wow

116
00:06:45,090 --> 00:06:47,070
That's no joke

117
00:06:47,070 --> 00:06:49,842
Go inside and sleep

118
00:06:49,843 --> 00:06:51,430
He didn't even drink that much

119
00:06:51,430 --> 00:06:52,450
And already drunk

120
00:06:52,450 --> 00:06:53,440
Seriously

121
00:06:53,440 --> 00:06:54,550
He must be tired

122
00:06:54,550 --> 00:06:55,870
I'll take him in

123
00:06:55,870 --> 00:06:57,680
Yeah okay

124
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:18,180
Wow… like this

125
00:07:18,180 --> 00:07:18,930
You can't do that

126
00:07:18,930 --> 00:07:19,650
Want me to carry you?

127
00:07:19,650 --> 00:07:21,080
No

128
00:07:21,080 --> 00:07:23,643
Why not

129
00:07:28,900 --> 00:07:30,590
Jin…

130
00:07:42,300 --> 00:07:43,900
I'm going to make kimchi this week

131
00:07:43,900 --> 00:07:46,430
You should go help your mom a bit

132
00:07:46,430 --> 00:07:47,706
But my back hurts..

133
00:07:47,707 --> 00:07:49,860
Come on you're young

134
00:07:57,540 --> 00:07:59,990
By the way before I moved in

135
00:07:59,990 --> 00:08:01,920
Who used to live here?

136
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:06,890
Oh a guy named Jin lived here for about a year

137
00:08:06,890 --> 00:08:08,990
His name is Jin?

138
00:08:08,990 --> 00:08:10,430
Yeah

139
00:08:10,430 --> 00:08:11,530
Jin Ha

140
00:08:11,530 --> 00:08:13,713
Ah Jin Ha…

141
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:17,770
Is it that guy in the photo?

142
00:08:17,770 --> 00:08:19,180
Why do you ask?

143
00:08:19,180 --> 00:08:22,000
Just curious

144
00:08:22,820 --> 00:08:25,410
So when's the kimchi making day

145
00:08:25,960 --> 00:08:28,080
No idea probably this Saturday

146
00:08:28,081 --> 00:08:29,508
We're making like eighty cabbages

147
00:08:29,509 --> 00:08:30,877
Eighty?

148
00:08:34,810 --> 00:08:36,650
Are you still sleeping?

149
00:08:40,670 --> 00:08:42,910
I'm still a little hungover

150
00:08:42,910 --> 00:08:44,180
Drink this

151
00:08:44,180 --> 00:08:46,272
Thanks

152
00:08:52,093 --> 00:08:55,633
You kept calling the name Jin last night

153
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:56,680
Did I?

154
00:08:56,680 --> 00:08:57,390
Yeah

155
00:08:57,390 --> 00:09:00,160
Heard that he was your old roommate

156
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:01,540
How did you know?

157
00:09:01,540 --> 00:09:03,502
I asked the others

158
00:09:03,503 --> 00:09:05,410
I was curious

159
00:09:05,411 --> 00:09:08,400
How much did they tell you..?

160
00:09:08,400 --> 00:09:11,140
Not much really

161
00:09:11,140 --> 00:09:13,080
Why was something going on between you two?

162
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:14,150
Huh?

163
00:09:14,150 --> 00:09:17,110
No it's not like that at all

164
00:09:17,110 --> 00:09:19,170
That's a relief

165
00:09:19,170 --> 00:09:21,390
I almost got jealous

166
00:09:21,390 --> 00:09:23,310
Huh?

167
00:09:29,300 --> 00:09:32,000
"Sharehouse Part.2"
